target/
node_modules/
*.o
*.log
req/lean/.lake/

# 🔴 M6 hand 1 (M6H1-5). discipline 44 puts mutation output **outside** `target/`, and nothing ignored the (sem: SEM-.gitignore-001)
# place it lands: `mutants.out/` has shown up as untracked in every `git status` since M5, and a
# `git add -A` in any hand would have committed ninety-odd generated diffs. The rule that put it here
# is the same one that has to keep it out of history.
mutants.out/

# 🔴 M6 hand 7. The Bearer token `docker-compose.yaml` bind-mounts at `/run/secrets/gx-token`
# (44 §2.5 makes the token **required**, and E-M6-23 has `gx serve` take it as a **path** so that the (sem: SEM-.gitignore-002)
# value never reaches `ps`). It is a secret an operator writes at the repository root because that
# is where a compose file's relative bind source resolves; a repository that has committed one has
# published it.
/gx-token

# 🔴 P4 (req/132 §5 item 1). `sdk/typescript/dist/` is `tsc`'s output (rebuilt by `npm run build`);
# `sdk/typescript/src/wasm-gen/` is `wasm-bindgen`'s output over `sdk/wasm-verify`'s compiled
# `.wasm` (rebuilt by `sdk/wasm-verify/build.sh`). Both are regenerable from source the same way
# `target/` is, and neither is `node_modules/`'s shape (already covered above).
sdk/typescript/dist/
sdk/typescript/src/wasm-gen/

# 🔴 M8-c (req/142 §1 M8-c, req/145_M8C_IMPL_REPORT_2026-08-14.md). `conformance/*.jsonl` is
# regenerated byte-for-byte by the three generator `#[test]` functions (fixed proptest seed) every
# `cargo test --workspace` run, which is what `tools/e2e.sh`'s clone-based gate already exercises
# -- committing it would only add diff noise on every future proptest/rustc version bump with no
# reproducibility gained. `conformance/schema/*.json` is hand-authored and stays tracked.
# `conformance/divergences/` is empty on a green run (46 §3.3) and a real artefact to inspect when
# it is not, which is exactly `target/`'s shape.
conformance/*.jsonl
conformance/divergences/

# scratch scripts left by lanes/sessions and a mis-expanded $HOME target dir (req/38 §128): never tracked
tools/_scratch_*
tools/_wire_*
